# labelmaker

Python 3.11 command-line tool that prints shipping labels as plain-text files.

## Layout

- `src/labelmaker/cli.py` parses the command line.
- `src/labelmaker/carriers/` holds one module per carrier.
- Carrier rates load from `config/rates.toml`.
- Labels render through `reportlab`; keep its version pinned in `pyproject.toml`.

## Commands

- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` runs the tests (set `PYTHONPATH=src`).
